---
// D-CHK-1: Checkout architecture. Static, theme-aware inline SVG (spec §13). No props.
---
<svg id="d-chk-1" viewBox="0 0 960 368" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="d-chk-1-title d-chk-1-desc" style="max-width:960px;height:auto;display:block;margin-inline:auto;color:var(--text-muted)" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <title id="d-chk-1-title">Checkout architecture</title>
  <desc id="d-chk-1-desc">The app calls the API gateway, which routes to the checkout service. Checkout fans out to the payment service, which calls the payment-gateway service and then PayU or Razorpay, and to the order-processing service, which writes an idempotency record in DynamoDB before the order store. The gateway's webhook returns to the payment-gateway service, which calls the checkout completion endpoint; this payment path is the highlighted happy path.</desc>
  <style is:inline>#d-chk-1 text{font-family:var(--font-mono);text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:central}#d-chk-1 .t{fill:var(--text);font-size:15px}#d-chk-1 .s{fill:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px}#d-chk-1 .cap{text-anchor:start;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}#d-chk-1 .b{fill:var(--bg-elev);stroke:currentColor;stroke-opacity:.5;stroke-width:1.5}#d-chk-1 .p{fill:var(--bg-sunk);stroke:var(--border);stroke-width:1.5}#d-chk-1 .l{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linejoin:round}#d-chk-1 .hl{stroke:var(--accent)}#d-chk-1 .d{stroke-dasharray:6 5}#d-chk-1 .ma{fill:currentColor}#d-chk-1 .mah{fill:var(--accent)}#d-chk-1 .ht{fill:var(--accent)}</style>
